 "exact_rules": [
  "Decide once a day at the close of UTC day D (candle closes 00:00 UTC = 07:00 Vietnam time), using BTCUSDT daily closes up to and including D.",
  "If BTCUSDT has no candle on D: change nothing.",
  "Warm-up: with fewer than 201 closes the target weight is 0 (history window used: 203 closes).",
  "For each n in (50, 75, 100, 125, 150, 175, 200): vote_n = 1 if close_D > mean of the last n closes (D included), else 0.",
  "Target BTC weight w* = (sum of votes) / 7, so steps of 1/7; the rest of the NAV stays in USDT. No leverage, no shorting.",
  "Let w = current BTC weight at D's close. If (w > 0.005) differs from (w* > 0.005), trade to w*. Otherwise trade to w* only when |w - w*| > 0.10; else no order.",
  "Orders are market orders filled at D+1's open, planned with ledger.plan_target_weights (min_trade_pct 0.5 in the research form; the bot's default 1.0 gives identical results on every split).",
  "Costs assumed in all numbers: 0.1% taker fee per fill + 0.1% slippage per fill; cash earns 0."
 ],
